Package: DropoutKiller
Type: Package
Title: Selective Dropout Recovery for Single-Cell RNA Sequencing
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("DropoutKiller", "Developers", email = "dropoutkiller@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Detects high-confidence technical zero events in single-cell RNA-seq
    data using SuperCell-style local memberships and ALRA-inspired adaptive
    low-rank thresholding, then selectively recovers only those events using
    membership-constrained latent-space neighbor borrowing with estimated
    Gaussian weights. Observed non-zero values are never overwritten.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/1667857557/dropout-killer
